<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia April producer prices rise 6.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia April producer prices rise 6.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday:</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES	   May	 April    May 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change  (pct)	     +0.4	 +0.4	-0.7</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)	    +6.2	 +5.0	+6.5</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
